title: 'Dimensions S1.2 merged: contracts, host-stamped authorship, and an upgrade that does not break installed mods'
summary: 'PR #103 merged into feat/gnomon-dimensions, ten of ten CI jobs green. The dimension contracts are published (dim-shape:v1, content-palette:v1), both founder-signed contract moves are spent in this one change, the mod host stamps authorship on every mod append, and installed first-party mods keep running across the modAbiId move without a single approval card.'
